# Secrets. `.env*.local` covers .env.local and .env.production.local;
# the bare `.env` and `.env.*` lines matter just as much, because a token
# pasted into `.env` would otherwise be committed. `.env.example` is the one
# deliberate exception — it holds key NAMES only, never values.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.env*.local
/.vercel
next-env.d.ts

certificates